{"content":[{"c":["ELHANAN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Hebrew soldier who distinguished himself by killing a Philistine giant. In one passage he is named as the son of Jaare-oregim of Bethlehem, and is said to have killed Goliath the Gittite (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.21.19","r":"2Sam.21.19","rawR":"2Sam.21.19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.21.19","value":"2Sam.21.19"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 21:19"},"). In another passage he is named as the son of Jair, and is said to have killed Lahmi, the brother of Goliath (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.20.5","r":"1Chr.20.5","rawR":"1Chr.20.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.20.5","value":"1Chr.20.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 20:5"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Dodo’s son and warrior among King David’s mighty men (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.23.24","r":"2Sam.23.24","rawR":"2Sam.23.24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.23.24","value":"2Sam.23.24"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 23:24"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.11.26","r":"1Chr.11.26","rawR":"1Chr.11.26","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.11.26","value":"1Chr.11.26"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 11:26"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Elhanan","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 21:19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.21.19","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.21.19","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.21.19"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 20:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.20.5","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.20.5","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.20.5"},{"anchorText":"2 Sm 23:24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.23.24","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.23.24","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.23.24"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 11:26","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.11.26","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.11.26","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.11.26"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"cff337ba73cbced03784ba2e7e6f9494c4066d48cdc6e1481c5247ebbe4036fc","sourceItemName":"Elhanan","sourceItemOrder":80,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Elhanan","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Elhanan","title":"Elhanan","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}